{"id":2356780,"shortDescription":"Dungeon Clawler es un «roguelike» de construcción de mazos con una máquina de garra. ¡Crea tu mazo, consigue armas y objetos con la máquina de garra, lucha contra los enemigos, descubre ventajas que crean sinergias increíbles y ejecuta combinaciones locas mientras te abres paso por la mazmorra!","developers":["Stray Fawn Studio"],"publishers":["Stray Fawn Studio"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Comodidad de la cámara","Controles de volumen personalizados","Dificultad ajustable","Opción solo teclado","Opción solo ratón","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualSense","Compatible con DualSense","Sonido estéreo","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"30 ABR 2026","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2356780?t=1795093669","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/098eddcb263122a34ceaca545ec759eea88db721/ss_098eddcb263122a34ceaca545ec759eea88db721.600x338.jpg?t=1795093669","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/098eddcb263122a34ceaca545ec759eea88db721/ss_098eddcb263122a34ceaca545ec759eea88db721.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795093669"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/f375813a71c7a5e441e6368d158dd216715ff655/ss_f375813a71c7a5e441e6368d158dd216715ff655.600x338.jpg?t=1795093669","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/f375813a71c7a5e441e6368d158dd216715ff655/ss_f375813a71c7a5e441e6368d158dd216715ff655.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795093669"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356780/3ddcde0f8cf4d682f4db7b99e6ca002a4ca2f64d/ss_3ddcde0f8cf4d682f4db7b99e6ca002a4ca2f64d.600x338.jpg?t=1795093669","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_